  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS-9905 Biodiversity Finance Plan Panama</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Since 2013, UNDP has implemented BIOFIN. BIOFIN has developed an evolving methodology to assess national biodiversity expenditures, financial needs and facilitate the design of national biodiversity finance plans, and strategies to reduce the needs to a level where national biodiversity targets can be achieved (The BIOFIN Workbook). A menu of options was designed to enable countries to select any financing solution utilized around the world (i.e., the Catalogue of Biodiversity Finance Solutions)</narrative>
  </description>
